# 📌 Project Checklist

## 📁 General Project Structure & Code Quality
- [ ] Ensure consistent folder structure (`client`, `server`, `common`, `utilities`).
- [ ] Remove unused files and dependencies.
- [ ] Add meaningful comments in complex parts of the code.
- [ ] Ensure proper naming conventions for variables, functions, and files.
- [ ] Optimize code reusability using components, hooks, and utility functions.
- [ ] Check environment variables (`.env`) and use `.env.example` for reference.

---

## 🎨 Frontend (Client)
### **UI/UX & Performance**
- [ ] Ensure all UI components are responsive across devices.
- [ ] Optimize image sizes and use lazy loading where needed.
- [ ] Improve loading states & skeleton loaders for better UX.
- [ ] Ensure dark mode & accessibility features are present if required.
- [ ] Remove unnecessary console logs and debugging code.

### **Authentication & Authorization**
- [ ] Implement OTP-based authentication correctly.
- [ ] Ensure JWT is stored securely (HTTP-only cookies/localStorage).
- [ ] Implement proper access control for protected routes (AuthContext, ProtectedRoute).

### **Notifications**
- [ ] Implement real-time notifications via WebSockets.
- [ ] Ensure Web Push Notifications work even when the user is offline.
- [ ] Allow users to clear notifications from the dashboard.
- [ ] Implement a toggle switch to enable/disable notifications.

### **Chat System**
- [ ] Ensure real-time chat updates without page refresh.
- [ ] Show unread message indicators in the sidebar.
- [ ] Allow file uploads (images, documents) in chat (if required).

### **Listings & Agreements**
- [ ] Implement listing creation, updates, and deletion properly.
- [ ] Ensure agreement templates (Car, House) are correctly filled and signed.
- [ ] Add search and filter functionality for listings.
- [ ] Validate forms before submission to prevent incorrect data.

---

## 🖥 Backend (Server)
### **Database & Models**
- [ ] Ensure all TypeORM models are correctly structured.
- [ ] Use migrations and seeders for database consistency.
- [ ] Optimize indexes and relations for better query performance.

### **API Structure & Optimization**
- [ ] Move business logic to services (controllers should only handle requests).
- [ ] Implement proper error handling (Try/Catch, Middleware).
- [ ] Validate API requests using Joi/Zod/Yup.
- [ ] Optimize database queries to avoid unnecessary calls.

### **Authentication & Security**
- [ ] Hash passwords before storing in the database.
- [ ] Implement rate limiting to prevent brute-force attacks.
- [ ] Use refresh tokens for better authentication flow.
- [ ] Ensure CORS is properly configured.

### **WebSockets (Real-time Features)**
- [ ] Implement real-time notifications using Socket.io.
- [ ] Optimize Socket connections (disconnect when unused).
- [ ] Ensure the chat sidebar updates in real-time.

---

## 🗄 Testing
### **Unit & Integration Testing**
- [ ] Write unit tests for critical functions (Jest/Mocha).
- [ ] Implement integration tests for API endpoints (Supertest/Postman).
- [ ] Test real-time WebSockets communication.

### **Manual Testing Checklist**
- [ ] Test all CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete).
- [ ] Ensure authentication (OTP, JWT) works correctly.
- [ ] Verify chat updates instantly.
- [ ] Test file uploads (media, agreements, user avatars).
- [ ] Ensure notifications are received properly.
- [ ] Check UI responsiveness on mobile, tablet, and desktop.

---

## 🔐 Security & Best Practices
- [ ] Use Helmet.js to set secure HTTP headers.
- [ ] Prevent SQL Injection & NoSQL Injection attacks.
- [ ] Validate user input on both frontend & backend.
- [ ] Implement 2FA (if required).
- [ ] Monitor API activity for unusual traffic.

---

## 🚀 Deployment & DevOps
### **Backend Deployment**
- [ ] Dockerize the application for consistency.
- [ ] Deploy on Vercel/Render/EC2/DigitalOcean.
- [ ] Set up CI/CD pipelines for automatic deployments.
- [ ] Monitor logs & errors using a logging service (e.g., PM2, LogRocket).

### **Frontend Deployment**
- [ ] Optimize React build using `vite build`.
- [ ] Deploy on Vercel/Netlify.
- [ ] Use CDN for static assets.

### **Database & Scaling**
- [ ] Set up PostgreSQL on a cloud database provider.
- [ ] Implement database backup & restore strategy.
- [ ] Optimize database queries & indexing.

---

## ✅ Final Checks
- [ ] Run end-to-end testing before final deployment.
- [ ] Ensure all environment variables are correctly set.
- [ ] Remove unused dependencies (`npm prune`).
- [ ] Check for memory leaks & performance issues.
